[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1501.909, "timestamp": "00:25:01", "text": "すべてがビデオ編集と同じようなものです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1505.43, "timestamp": "00:25:05", "text": "ソフトウェアでも音楽でも何でもいいんだけど、えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1507.909, "timestamp": "00:25:07", "text": "考えなければならないし、もし見つけることができれば"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1510.87, "timestamp": "00:25:10", "text": "UIを理解していれば可能です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1513.669, "timestamp": "00:25:13", "text": "そして私が道を切り開くことができるものすべて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1516.63, "timestamp": "00:25:16", "text": "私が何をしようとしているかに関わらず"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1519.269, "timestamp": "00:25:19", "text": "私は頭の中で、自分ならできると想像した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1522.59, "timestamp": "00:25:22", "text": "この物に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1527.19, "timestamp": "00:25:27", "text": "結果はコンピューター上で表示されると思います。うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1529.35, "timestamp": "00:25:29", "text": "しかし、それには時間がかかる。非常に長い時間がかかります"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1530.99, "timestamp": "00:25:30", "text": "時間。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1539.99, "timestamp": "00:25:39", "text": "だから、注射の場合も同様です。私はそれを知っています"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1542.149, "timestamp": "00:25:42", "text": "字幕が不足していて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1545.029, "timestamp": "00:25:45", "text": "すべて。私がやらない理由は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1548.789, "timestamp": "00:25:48", "text": "クリップがたくさんあるから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1551.99, "timestamp": "00:25:51", "text": "座って編集したくない"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1554.549, "timestamp": "00:25:54", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "normally when i do vid, i gotta make scripts, find sound effects, find highlights, trimming vids, brainstorm for editting, etc. omaigah UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/7cIfY5niDOmSkNAP08CA6A4"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1555.029, "timestamp": "00:25:55", "text": "すべての